'''Dwarven Tavern''' is a location inside the [[Dwarven Village]]. This location has {{Green|5}} NPCs: four drunks ({{NPCSprite|Gimley}}, {{NPCSprite|Hornum}}, {{NPCSprite|Tarwen}}, and {{NPCSprite|Sargwyn}}) and {{NPCSprite|Brynmor}}, the bartender.

== Purpose ==
The tavern is a two-storied building, although only the first floor is accessible. Four tables can be found inside, and three outside: the aforementioned NPCs sit inside the tavern. Talking to them and replying with "''burp''" will reward a {{Item|Dwarven Tankard}}.

{{NPCSprite|Brynmor}} sells the {{Item|Powder Pie}}, {{Item|Filet O' Fortune}}, and {{Item|Chilled Pristine Potato}}, each of which require higher [[Heart of the Mountain|HotM]] levels to purchase.

